-up point for student-organization information, especially if you miss an activities fair during the semester.","short_summary":"A named campus hub for connecting with student organizations.","evidence_claim":"St. John’s identifies the Student Engagement Resource Center in D’Angelo Center Room 125 as a place to get involved after missing an activities fair.","source_url":"https://www.stjohns.edu/queens-residential-campus/queens-campus-life/campus-activities/commuter-student-life","source_title":"Commuter Student Life | St. John's University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The University lists hours as Monday–Thursday 9 a.m.–7 p.m. and Friday 9 a.m.–3 p.m.; verify changes before going.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sju-fitness-trail","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"St. John’s Fitness Trail","title":"Take the Marked Fitness Trail","subtitle":"Saturday morning · Start outside the DAC near Spirit Rock","notes":"Choose the one-mile or 1.5-mile marked route. Start outside the D’Angelo Center near Spirit Rock and follow the light-pole markers for your route.","short_summary":"A choice of two marked walking and running loops on campus.","evidence_claim":"St. John’s maintains one-mile and 1.5-mile fitness trails on the Queens campus, both starting outside the D’Angelo Center near Spirit Rock.","source_url":"https://www.stjohns.edu/life-st-johns/new-york-locations/queens-residential-campus/campus-recreation","source_title":"Campus Recreation | St. John's University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the posted trail map and normal pedestrian awareness; routes are outdoors on campus.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sju-carnesecca-fitness-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Carnesecca Fitness Center","title":"Find the Carnesecca Fitness Center","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Carnesecca Fitness Center, Room B-02","notes":"Locate the recreation office and fitness-center area so a future workout feels straightforward. Bring an active StormCard if you plan to use recreation facilities.","short_summary":"The Queens-campus base for Campus Recreation.","evidence_claim":"The University lists the Campus Recreation office in Carnesecca Fitness Center, Room B-02, and states that a valid St. John’s ID is required for fitness-center use.","source_url":"https://www.stjohns.edu/life-st-johns/new-york-locations/queens-residential-campus/campus-recreation","source_title":"Campus Recreation | St. John's University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Regular Campus Recreation hours are listed as 8 a.m.–11 p.m. Monday–Thursday, 8 a.m.–8 p.m. Friday, and 11 a.m.–7 p.m. weekends; hours can change for closures.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sju-university-learning-commons","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"University Learning Commons","title":"Find the Learning Commons Before Classes Intensify","subtitle":"Saturday · St. Augustine Hall, Room 103","notes":"Walk to Room 103 next to Einstein Bagels and note the tutoring location. Bring your StormCard when you return for an appointment or a walk-in check.","short_summary":"An on-campus tutoring location in the library building.","evidence_claim":"The University Learning Commons offers in-person and virtual tutoring and is located in St. Augustine Hall (Library), Room 103.","source_url":"https://www.stjohns.edu/life-st-johns/student-success/university-learning-commons","source_title":"University Learning Commons | St. John's University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The University says students need StormCards to enter this space; it lists Sunday evening online tutoring, rather than in-person Sunday access.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sju-yeh-art-gallery","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Dr. M. T. Geoffrey Yeh Art Gallery","title":"See What Is Showing at Yeh Art Gallery","subtitle":"Saturday · Sun Yat Sen Hall","notes":"Check the current exhibition page, then visit the gallery in Sun Yat Sen Hall during posted hours. Use the accessible rear entrance if needed.","short_summary":"A contemporary-art gallery with changing exhibitions on the Queens campus.","evidence_claim":"The Dr. M. T. Geoffrey Yeh Art Gallery exhibits contemporary art on the Queens campus and is located in Sun Yat Sen Hall.","source_url":"https://www.stjohns.edu/offices-departments/dr-m-t-geoffrey-yeh-art-gallery","source_title":"Dr. M. T. Geoffrey Yeh Art Gallery | St. John's University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Posted hours are Tuesday–Friday 10 a.m.–5 p.m. and Saturday noon–5 p.m., plus appointments; confirm the current exhibition and access before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sju-st-thomas-more-church","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"St. Thomas More Church","title":"Build in a Quiet Church Stop","subtitle":"Sunday · St. Thomas More Church, Queens campus","notes":"If a quiet, reflective pause fits your weekend, visit the church during its published open hours. This is a campus option; participation in services is personal.","short_summary":"A named Queens-campus church open daily for private prayer.","evidence_claim":"St. John’s states that St. Thomas More Church on the Queens campus is open daily from 7:30 a.m. to 10 p.m.","source_url